Netanyahu secretly met UAE President in Abu Dhabi






                Israeli Prime Minister Benjamin Netanyahu had a secret meeting with UAE&nbsp;President Sheikh Mohamed bin Zayed Al Nahyan in Abu Dhabi, according to Israeli media reports.&nbsp;

Netanyahu travelled to Abu Dhabi on a private plane,&nbsp;Israel’s Channel 12 indicated.&nbsp;

